\" and threatens \"아동학대인 거 알고 계시죠?\". The teacher, who had been afraid of her students, stands up to her for the first time. Later Ye-ri tries to post the teacher’s personal details, the post gets deleted, and instead the original of her own fake abuse-accusation video spreads. It ends on her face as it all falls apart.\nNo overlap: It doesn’t reuse any part of the earlier short (episode 3, around 20:22–22:42). Both overlap checks passed with 0%.\nTitle: 「담임 우습게 보던 / 인플루언서 거울치료」 (16 characters).\nNarration: 4 lines, about 2–2.5 seconds each, have been made with the paid Typecast voice. The checker flagged 2 of them ('담임이' heard as [다미미], '분필을' as [분피를]), but that’s just normal Korean pronunciation, so I kept them rather than pay to redo them.\n\nStill to do: build, label and face confirmation, render, review, then the final check. That will take a while. Once it’s finished I’ll give you the path to the completed video and what to check by ear (whether subtitles match the speech, whether any line starts or endings are clipped, and volume).","u":"fbeab310"},{"i":"159e2b5bb6","t":"14:04:47","s":"박@린(코니코니)","k":"etc","x":"이렇게되고 종료되네요 ㅠㅠ","u":"fbeab310"},{"i":"1d7a297fe7","t":"14:15:45","s":"아모르(천상계영드)","k":"etc","x":"캡처랑 같이 코니코니님 클로드코드에 이렇게 보내 보세요 👇\n\n\"한드짜 만들다가 중간에 멈췄어. CHAMED02 이어서 끝까지 만들어줘.\n스킬 지시서대로 엔진 명령으로만 만들고, 직접 렌더 코드 짜지 마.\n엔진 명령이 실패하면 오류 줄 그대로 보여주고 멈춰.\"\n\n그래도 안 되면 그때 나온 오류 메시지 캡처해서 보내 주세요!","u":"46288940"},{"i":"e31041322f","t":"14:15:57","s":"아모르(천상계영드)","k":"etc","x":"클코에 물어보면 즉답을 해줍니당","u":"46288940"},{"i":"3e98f96225","t":"14:17:49","s":"박@린(코니코니)","k":"etc","x":"저만 질문공격 퍼붓는거 같아서 죄송합니둥...","u":"fbeab310"},{"i":"f9ebf63ac4","t":"14:54:09","s":"박@린(코니코니)","k":"etc","x":"혹시 1대1일 오픈챗 가능할까요?","u":"fbeab310"},{"i":"03aa4cfa88","t":"14:54:26","s":"박@린(코니코니)","k":"etc","x":"질문있습니당..ㅜ","u":"fbeab310"},{"i":"bba027546d","t":"14:54:33","s":"박@린(코니코니)","k":"etc","x":"조교님들","u":"fbeab310"},{"i":"0ba71728f7","t":"14:56:15","s":"[조교] 나물쓰","k":"etc","x":"https://open.k